   hi over the nine within-round deltas share a sign. The range below is over the
   configurations where it did separate, as a percentage of cell A; quoting a
   range over the subset with the wanted sign is exactly what the sign column
   exists to stop, so the COUNT is printed beside it and is the thing to read.
   A difference that separates in a minority of configurations has not separated.

